site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c151272"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"新婚ホヤホヤで、近年近所に越してきた専業主婦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"可愛らしい若奥さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、引っ越してきた途端に夫が単身赴任することになり、孤閨を囲うことになってしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まだ新婚で、セックスしたい盛りのゆう奈は、杜実に誘われサークルに参加することに。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫ではない男に抱かれることに躊躇も恥じらいもあるが、いったんスイッチが入ると変態的プレイも積極的にこなすようになる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27609","sourceWorkId":"38274","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"外見年齢２２歳"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"新婚ホヤホヤで、近年近所に越してきた専業主婦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"可愛らしい若奥さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、引っ越してきた途端に夫が単身赴任することになり、孤閨を囲うことになってしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まだ新婚で、セックスしたい盛りのゆう奈は、杜実に誘われサークルに参加することに。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫ではない男に抱かれることに躊躇も恥じらいもあるが、いったんスイッチが入ると変態的プレイも積極的にこなすようになる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"216762"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bb/bbd5b7d293615fe182b97efe168db8a86feb54ee0d10154203e48e3ebad5db08.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ad/adb3c25fc6c0b66816756ed2795695a78b01ab58c7dd1b63fec3c8dd0d8965fe.webp","width":114,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"水城すい","creatorId":"vndb:s35850","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s35850","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s35850","name":"水城すい","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:549062:216762:76183:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c151273","characterName":"有明 ヒメ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"216763","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"549062"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27610"],"vndbCharacterId":"c151273"},"originalCharacterName":"有明 ヒメ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"age":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"24"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Last year, a popular cosplayer married a professional athlete. Ariake Hime is her cosplay name; her real name is unknown."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While various scandals circulate about her, she genuinely enjoys cosplay and wants to entertain her audience."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Though they met through work, it was a passionate love match, and they're basically lovey-dovey."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lately, however, her husband's busy overseas work schedule has led to frequent separations, leaving her alone at home."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She lives in an apartment near Morimi's house, having met him at the fitness club. She's always enjoyed sex and had plenty of experience before meeting her husband."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When Morimi invited her to join his circle, she jumped at the chance."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She says herself, “Getting filmed turns me on the most,” and often suggests play involving cosplay."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From official site"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c151273"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"去年、人気マンガ家と結婚した人気コスプレイヤー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"有明ヒメはコスネームで、本名は不詳。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世間ではいろいろスキャンダルも聞かれるが、本人はコスプレを心から楽しんでおり、見るひとを楽しませたいとも思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫とも仕事で知り合ったとはいえ熱烈な恋愛結婚で、基本的にはラブラブ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただ最近は、人気作を連発し仕事が忙しくなった夫とすれ違うことが多く、孤閨を囲っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"杜実の家の近くのマンション住まいで、杜実とはフィットネスクラブで知り合った。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"もともとセックスは好きな方で、夫と出会う前の経験は豊富。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"杜実にサークルに誘われ、ふたつ返事でとびついた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人曰く「撮られてるときがいちばんアガる」とのことで、コスプレイを絡めたプレイを提案してくる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27610","sourceWorkId":"38274","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"外見年齢２４歳"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"去年、プロスポーツ選手と結婚した人気コスプレイヤー。"},{"spoiler":false,"text